            "words": 74,
            "approxSeconds": 32,
            "lines": [
              "Welcome to Section 2 of the module on Blood Culture Sampling.",
              "In Section 1 you learned what a bloodstream infection is, when to collect, how many sets, how much blood, where to draw from and in what order.",
              "This section is the procedure itself: the nineteen steps from verifying the order to sending the bottles, how contamination happens and how to prevent it, how results are interpreted, and what the nurse is accountable for."
            ],
