            "audioFile": "m2_2_15_base.mp3",
            "words": 56,
            "approxSeconds": 24,
            "lines": [
              "Although blood culture collection is generally safe, some complications may occur.",
              "Haematoma formation at the puncture site.",
              "Bleeding.",
              "Pain.",
              "Vasovagal syncope, which may cause dizziness or fainting - stay with the patient.",
              "And needlestick injury to the healthcare worker, if sharps are not handled properly.",
              "Careful technique and adherence to safety precautions minimise all of these."
            ],
