            "approxSeconds": 34,
            "lines": [
              "A blood culture collection audit assesses whether each step of the procedure is performed correctly and consistently.",
              "Hand hygiene.",
              "Appropriate use of personal protective equipment.",
              "Correct skin antisepsis.",
              "Allowing the antiseptic to dry completely before venipuncture.",
              "Whether the recommended blood volume was collected.",
              "Whether the specimen was labelled accurately at the bedside.",
              "And whether the bottles were transported promptly to the laboratory.",
              "Regular auditing identifies gaps in practice, reduces contamination rates, and improves the overall quality of blood culture collection."
            ],
